 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le13ob10re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le13ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le13ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le13ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Peter. Peter? Wake up. The movie is over.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What happened? I didn't fall asleep did I?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Yes. You snored through the last scene.You passed out before the couple decided to break up.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh Gosh! I apologize. I want you to know that I did really enjoy the first half. Wasn't it romantic?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Actually, I was taken aback by how shallow the characters were. I cracked up a couple of times though."}, {"time": "31500", "image": "engenn8le13ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> So I guess you guys didn't like it much. It wasn't that good.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Amy:</span> Hey, lighten up! I love criticizing films. You obviously didn't like it much either did you?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Not really, I guess.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Amy:</span> It doesn't matter. Cheer up! I had fun seeing the movie with you. Aren't we going out to eat now?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Definitely! Let's try that little cafe around the corner."}, {"time": "54500", "image": "engenn8le13ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Isn't it a beautiful evening? I could just fall in love ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Really? You could fall in love ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: \u2026 with the Boston skyline! What a great city!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah. Don't you think the skyline is very romantic?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: I'd say it's magical, but on another note my stomach is rumbling. Let's get dinner! Didn't you say it was just around the corner?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I most certainly did!"}]}}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}